Open follow-ups (from latest compare report)
============================================

- Investigate why emerge plan-fails on www-servers/nginx and
  media-gfx/graphviz while portage-ng plans both with assumptions.
  Decide whether portage-ng should also reject (or whether emerge is
  too strict here).
- net-irc/irssi: portage-ng pulls in dev-lang/perl-5.42.2 even though
  perl is part of stage3. Likely a vartree-vs-VDB lookup difference
  in build-time-only dep handling. Trace through prover/vdb.
- net-irc/irssi: portage-ng selects irssi-1.4.5-r2, emerge picks
  irssi-1.4.5. Check preference predicate / version-selection logic.


